        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Comfy MiniMax H3 Max Turbo- Image to Video\n\nGenerate video sequences from a starting image using MiniMax H3 Max Turbo, producing two video outputs from a single input frame. This rapid image-to-video workflow generates short clips in seconds, with optional prompt enhancement and 2K upscaling stages. Ideal for animating still photographs, creating quick motion previews for storyboards, and fast visual effects iteration. Runs on Comfy Cloud and needs Comfy Cloud partner credits.\n\n**How it works:** The Comfy nodes form the complete template graph. Run submits the graph to Comfy Cloud and saves its outputs.\n\n**Try this:** Change the prompt or the Load node inputs and run again to compare results.\n\nSource: https://github.com/Comfy-Org/workflow_templates/blob/1ae390968e323dba24a6991d1860ded051f5a79b/templates/api_minimax_h3_max_turbo_i2v.json (MIT). Model licenses apply separately."
        },
